### Summary of Changes

In accordance with [task_gpa.md](file:///Users/sherifgamalradwan/anc-emr-android-native/docs/designs/redesign/out/task_gpa.md):

1. **[strings.xml](file:///Users/sherifgamalradwan/anc-emr-android-native/app/src/main/res/values/strings.xml)**:
   - Added string resource `<string name="nulliparous">Nulliparous</string>` before `</resources>`.

2. **[PatientDirectoryMetricsRow.kt](file:///Users/sherifgamalradwan/anc-emr-android-native/app/src/main/java/com/sherifradwan/ancnative/ui/patientdirectory/PatientDirectoryMetricsRow.kt)**:
   - Imported `com.sherifradwan.ancnative.model.previousDeliverySummary`.
   - In `ParityCell`, restored the secondary delivery summary line below the GPA metric value (`MetricValue(value = ltrIsolate(parityText))`):
     ```kotlin
     val prevDelivery = previousDeliverySummary(patient).takeIf { it.isNotBlank() }
         ?: stringResource(R.string.nulliparous)
     Text(
         text = prevDelivery,
         style = RecordType.MetricLabel,
         color = MaterialTheme.colorScheme.onSurfaceVariant,
         maxLines = 2,
         overflow = TextOverflow.Ellipsis,
     )
     ```
   - Styled using `RecordType.MetricLabel` (12sp body token) in `MaterialTheme.colorScheme.onSurfaceVariant`, wrapping up to 2 lines without clipping at 360dp width and 1.3 font scale.
